{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lost my Collection of Fish is a Hidden Object Game where you must find all Fish to complete the game.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\uddbc\ufe0f 1 Large Vector Artwork.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc1f\u00a0100 Hidden Fish.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfc6 Achievements.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udca1 No Hints or Support for extra challenge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfb5 Relaxing music and Ambience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2328\ufe0f Use only your Mouse to play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcbe Autosave. Pick up from where you left off.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\uddd1\ufe0f Reset progress and play again.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Controls:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hold Left Mouse Button + Mouse Movement: Pan and Movement in the level.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Press Left Mouse Button to Collect Fish.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Press ESC in-game to access the Pause Menu.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4048850?t=1759091540","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4048850?t=1759091540","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4048850/b6a82203290f5439960ee370539b92e20b59fc08/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759091540","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4048850/b6a82203290f5439960ee370539b92e20b59fc08/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759091540","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_d